OL,3,A'I took a chance on the whisky industry
OL,4,Aand I haven't looked back'
OL,5,
OL,6,FZoey Darnbrough is the first to admit
OL,7,Fthat just a few years ago she did not
OL,8,Feven know there was a whisky distillery
OL,9,Fnear her hometown in southern Scotland.
OL,11,FBut it hasn't stopped her rising
OL,12,Frapidly from tour guide, to group
OL,13,Ftourism and events co-ordinator at the
OL,14,Fsite near Annan.
OL,16,FShe went away to study heritage and
OL,17,Ftourism in Stirling after school, but
OL,18,Funlike many of her peers, she returned
OL,19,Fto Dumfries and Galloway for work.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
