OL,3,A'I took a chance on the whisky industry
OL,4,Aand I haven't looked back'
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow she hopes to play her part in
OL,7,Fchanging people's opinions of the world
OL,8,Fof whisky "one woman at a time".
